@api = http://localhost:5080

### Catálogo de materias (público)
GET {{api}}/api/subjects

### Login con estudiante de demostración
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana.garcia@registro.test", "password": "Demo1234" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Mis clases y compañeros (regla 9)
GET {{api}}/api/enrollments/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inscribir 3 materias con profesores distintos (reglas 5 y 7)
PUT {{api}}/api/enrollments/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subjectIds": [1, 4, 7] }

### Intento inválido: dos materias del mismo profesor
PUT {{api}}/api/enrollments/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subjectIds": [1, 2, 7] }

### Directorio de estudiantes (regla 8)
GET {{api}}/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
